//     archive and the old `>= 500` test called every one of them a temperature.
//   * it moved >= 40 C since the last trusted reading -- catches corruption that
//     lands inside the plausible band. Bad reads move a median +86.7 C between
//     samples; a loaded tunnel moves 0.15-0.45 C per minute.
